        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Become the Vampire Hunter </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the relentless vampire hunter Lovec, storm through a gothic mansion hidden deep in the forests of Bohemia. Wield devastating weapons, grow stronger with every victory, and carve a path through relentless hordes of haunting enemies on your quest to rescue your beloved Eliska from the wicked vampire lord, Mikhail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s time to hunt the Bane of Darkness.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Storm the vampire lord's lair!</strong> From the eerie Bohemian forest to a deadly mansion, explore the secrets hidden in the shadows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield devastating weapons!</strong> Collect and master lethal weapons that deal more damage as you get stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash into battle!</strong> Practice and use dash attack to vanquish foes at light speed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face relentless hordes of enemies!</strong> Skeletons, ghouls, skulls, and animated armor. Carve a path through them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse into the narrative!</strong> Cinematic cutscenes will envelop you into seamless gameplay.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a fusion of music!</strong> With influences from a variety of genres, the score from <i>Bane of Darkness </i>provides a unique take on haunted symphonies and heart-racing beats. <i> </i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142630/extras/2a88779afe63497df544d57213232f18.avif?t=1770586244\" width=1478 height=813 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extended Credits </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bane of Darkness is a student university project, created by the team SketchyCat Games:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Producer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sasha-Lee Kuzmanov</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead Designer….. Zerend Sandor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay and Level Design….. Zerend Sandor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative Design… Brenten Edwards &amp; Jorja McGrath</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logo Design…. Jorja McGrath &amp; Zerend Sandor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Score….. Sasha-Lee Kuzmanov</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay Music….. Dylan Yee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SFX Design…… Dylan Yee &amp; Sasha-Lee Kuzmanov</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Over Artist…… Brenten Edwards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead Artist….. Farhaan Hanif</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Cutscenes and Concept Designs…. Jorja McGrath</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI Art…. Jorja McGrath</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Environments…. Farhaan Hanif &amp; Kaelum Grossett   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Modelling and Animation….. Kaelum Grossett</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VFX….. Eli Merckel, Kaelum Grossett, Dylan Yee &amp; Zan Mohd Hazlan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Programming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead Programmer….. Eli Merckel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy Weapons and Movement….. Zan Mohd Hazlan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Weapons and Movement….. Eli Merckel &amp; Dylan Yee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI Programming….. Eli Merckel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimisation…. Farhaan Hanif</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtesting…. Zerend Sandor &amp; Brenten Edwards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug Fixing and Balancing…. Dylan Yee, Eli Merckel, Zerend Sandor &amp; Zan Mohd Hazlan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thank you for the support!</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Become the Vampire Hunter </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the relentless vampire hunter Lovec, storm through a gothic mansion hidden deep in the forests of Bohemia. Wield devastating weapons, grow stronger with every victory, and carve a path through relentless hordes of haunting enemies on your quest to rescue your beloved Eliska from the wicked vampire lord, Mikhail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s time to hunt the Bane of Darkness.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Storm the vampire lord's lair!</strong> From the eerie Bohemian forest to a deadly mansion, explore the secrets hidden in the shadows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield devastating weapons!</strong> Collect and master lethal weapons that deal more damage as you get stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash into battle!</strong> Practice and use dash attack to vanquish foes at light speed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face relentless hordes of enemies!</strong> Skeletons, ghouls, skulls, and animated armor. Carve a path through them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse into the narrative!</strong> Cinematic cutscenes will envelop you into seamless gameplay.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a fusion of music!</strong> With influences from a variety of genres, the score from <i>Bane of Darkness </i>provides a unique take on haunted symphonies and heart-racing beats. <i> </i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142630/extras/2a88779afe63497df544d57213232f18.avif?t=1770586244\" width=1478 height=813 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extended Credits </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bane of Darkness is a student university project, created by the team SketchyCat Games:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Producer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sasha-Lee Kuzmanov</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead Designer….. Zerend Sandor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay and Level Design….. Zerend Sandor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative Design… Brenten Edwards &amp; Jorja McGrath</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logo Design…. Jorja McGrath &amp; Zerend Sandor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Score….. Sasha-Lee Kuzmanov</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay Music….. Dylan Yee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SFX Design…… Dylan Yee &amp; Sasha-Lee Kuzmanov</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Over Artist…… Brenten Edwards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead Artist….. Farhaan Hanif</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Cutscenes and Concept Designs…. Jorja McGrath</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI Art…. Jorja McGrath</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Environments…. Farhaan Hanif &amp; Kaelum Grossett   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Modelling and Animation….. Kaelum Grossett</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VFX….. Eli Merckel, Kaelum Grossett, Dylan Yee &amp; Zan Mohd Hazlan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Programming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead Programmer….. Eli Merckel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy Weapons and Movement….. Zan Mohd Hazlan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Weapons and Movement….. Eli Merckel &amp; Dylan Yee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI Programming….. Eli Merckel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimisation…. Farhaan Hanif</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtesting…. Zerend Sandor &amp; Brenten Edwards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug Fixing and Balancing…. Dylan Yee, Eli Merckel, Zerend Sandor &amp; Zan Mohd Hazlan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thank you for the support!</i></p>",
